delayed delivery arrangements, and any commissions we may pay for solicitation of any such delayed delivery contracts;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

